<mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Transform: AWS Glue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;• Remove duplicates&lt;br&gt;• Standardise formats&lt;br&gt;• Validate values and ranges&lt;br&gt;• Pseudonymise MyKad (salted SHA-256)&lt;br&gt;• Assign surrogate keys&lt;br&gt;• Track patient history (SCD Type 2)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="st1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="200" width="270" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
