<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style='font-size:20px'&gt;KlinikSihat Data Warehouse Architecture (ETL)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='font-size:14px'&gt;Sources → Staging → Warehouse → Presentation&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1540" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="gov" value="&lt;b&gt;Governance &amp; PDPA 2010 (applies to every stage)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Personal and health data processed only for appointment care and service improvement (s.6, s.40)  • Security Principle: encryption, role-based access and audit log (s.9)&lt;br&gt;• Retention Principle: raw extracts deleted after 30 days (s.10)  • MyKad pseudonymised before loading  • All data stored in the AWS Malaysia region" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1540" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
